    "short_description": "Play as 2 personified Food girls, Takoyaki &amp; Tempura, and fight Mold People, in SPACE! Explore a whimsy, galactic food-themed society rich in flavour, engage in absurd pun-fueled combat, &amp; save the galaxy from Mold infection! But Mold People used to be Food People... Maybe there's another way?",
